H1609.def:
A man of the Edomites living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:11; 
son of: Eliphaz (H0464); 
brother of: Teman (H8487), Omar (H0201), Zepho (H6825), Kenaz (H7073), Amalek (H6002H) and Korah (H7141H) 
§ Gatam = "a burnt valley"
fourth son of Eliphaz and grandson of Esau and one of the dukes of Eliphaz

H1617G.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:21; 
son of: Benjamin (H1144); 
brother of: Bela (H1106A), Becher (H1071), Ashbel (H0788), Naaman (H5283), Ehi (H0278), Rosh (H7220), Muppim (H4649), Huppim (H2650H), Ard (H0714), Ahiram (H0297) and Jediael (H3043); 
father of: Ehud (H0164)
§ Gera = "a grain"
1) a son of Benjamin
2) a son of Bela and grandson of Benjamin
3) any member of the Gera family of the Benjamite tribe

H1617J.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living before Israel's Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:7; 
son of: Ehud (H0164); 
brother of: Naaman (H5283J), Ahijah (H0281K), Uzza (H5798H) and Ahihud (H0284); also called Heglam (KJV: "removed"; NIV: "deported") at 1 Chroniques 8:7; 
Also named: ga.lah (הֶגְלָם "Heglam" H1540)
§ Gera = "a grain"
1) a son of Benjamin
2) a son of Bela and grandson of Benjamin
3) any member of the Gera family of the Benjamite tribe

H1622.def:
Someone descended from Girgas(?) of the Canaanites, first mentioned at Genèse 10:16; descended from Canaan (H3667); along with Sidon (H6721), Heth (H2845), Jebusite (H2983), Amorite (H0567), Hivite (H2340), Arkite (H6208), Sinite (H5513), Arvadite (H0721), Zemarite (H6786) and Hamathite (H2577); also called in KJV: Girgasite; 
§ Girgashite or Girgasite = "dwelling on a clayey soil"
descendants of Canaan and one of the nations living east of the sea of Galilee when the Israelites entered the promised land

H1647G.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exode 2:22; 
son of: Moses (H4872) and Zipporah (H6855); 
brother of: Eliezer (H0461H); 
father of: Jonathan (H3083)(?) and Shebuel (H7619)
§ Gershom = "foreigner"
1) firstborn son of Moses and Zipporah
2) firstborn son of Levi
3) a son of the priestly family of Phinehas who returned from exile with Ezra

H1647H.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:11; 
son of: Levi (H3878); 
brother of: Kohath (H6955), Merari (H4847) and Jochebed (H3115); 
father of: Libni (H3845G) and Shimei (H8096G); also called Gershom at 1 Chroniques 6:16,17,20,43,62,71; 15.7; 
Another spelling of ge.re.shon (גֵּרְשׁוֹן "Gershon" H1648)
§ Gershom = "foreigner"
1) firstborn son of Moses and Zipporah
2) firstborn son of Levi
3) a son of the priestly family of Phinehas who returned from exile with Ezra

H1648.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:11; 
son of: Levi (H3878); 
brother of: Kohath (H6955), Merari (H4847) and Jochebed (H3115); 
father of: Libni (H3845) and Shimei (H8096); also called Gershom at 1 Chroniques 6:16,17,20,43,62,71; 15.7; 
§ Gershon or Gershom = "exile"
firstborn son of Levi born before Jacob's family went to Egypt

H1649.def:
Someone descended from Gershon who was a man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:11; 
son of: Levi (H3878); 
brother of: Kohath (H6955), Merari (H4847) and Jochebed (H3115); 
father of: Libni (H3845) and Shimei (H8096); also called Gershom at 1 Chroniques 6:16,17,20,43,62,71; 15.7; 
Group of ge.re.shon (גֵּרְשׁוֹן "Gershon" H1648) 
§ Gershonite , of Geshur
a descendant of Gershon, firstborn son of Levi

H1666.def:
A man of the Syrians living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 10:23; 
son of: Aram (H0758); 
brother of: Uz (H5780), Hul (H2343) and Mash (H4851) 
§ Gether = "fear"
the third in order of the sons of Aram
